{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as separate automata. The specification encodes a safe, coverage-oriented exploration policy: random_walk is favored in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are used only when obstacles are detected. Recovery is conservative but minimal, returning to exploration as soon as the path is clear. Only one controllable is enabled per state, and obstacle events always force a turn-recovery state before resuming exploration.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect modular robot hardware.",
    "Specification automaton encodes the exploration logic, ensuring safe transitions, minimal recovery, and strong coverage bias by alternating random_walk and move_forward in clear states."
